OL,3,GNEWSAWoman pregnant years after
OL,4,Alife-saving transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who received a double organ
OL,7,Ftransplant as a child says becoming
OL,8,Fpregnant would not have been possible
OL,9,Fwithout the family of her donor.
OL,11,FKeeleigh John, from Bridgwater in
OL,12,FSomerset, was diagnosed with chronic
OL,13,Frenal failure and underwent life-saving
OL,14,Fsurgery to receive a new liver and
OL,15,Fkidneys when she was 12 years old.
OL,17,FKeeleigh, now 28, said doctors had told
OL,18,Fher family it was unlikely she would
OL,19,Fever have children.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
